---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Hubungi RWADaily">
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto py-16 px-4 min-h-[60vh] bg-[#1a1c24] text-white">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Hubungi Kami</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-300">
      Punya saran berita, ingin mengirim siaran pers, atau berminat kolaborasi dengan tim RWADaily? 
      Jangan ragu untuk menghubungi kami melalui saluran di bawah ini:
    </p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="p-6 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl bg-gray-800/50">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">Email Redaksi</h2>
        <a href="mailto:rwadaily.biz@gmail.com" class="text-red-500 hover:text-red-400 font-medium underline">
          rwadaily.biz@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 border border-gray-700 rounded-xl bg-gray-800/50">
        <h2 class="font-bold mb-2">WhatsApp Bisnis</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-4 text-sm">Respon cepat setiap hari kerja.</p>
        
        <a 
          href="https://wa.me/6283870088809" 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center bg-black text-red-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold border border-red-600 hover:bg-red-900/20 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-1.612-.5-.314 0-.821.06-1.245.518-.423.457-1.612 1.574-1.612 3.837 0 2.263 1.649 4.453 1.876 4.752.228.298 3.23 4.943 7.825 6.929 1.09.467 1.944.746 2.607.957 1.097.348 2.096.3 2.882.181.882-.132 2.723-1.114 3.104-2.193.381-1.078.381-2.003.266-2.193-.114-.191-.423-.301-.72-.449z"/>
          </svg>
          Chat via WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <p><strong>Catatan:</strong> Kami berusaha membalas semua pesan dalam waktu 1x24 jam.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>